   "source": [
    "Write a function `count_up(max_num)` that prints numbers from 1 to max_num.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "f5e4c5e8",
